("api/item-text" :names ("item-text" "(setf item-text)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Copy native item text into an independent Lisp string. LIST-BOX and COMBO-BOX use explicit UTF-8 length; RADIO-BOX uses NUL-terminated UTF-8 with NUL-free constructor strings and native mnemonic normalization. Index is not durable identity." :position 164891)
