("api/stop-event-propagation" :names ("stop-event-propagation") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Set propagation level to zero. It does not set Skip; set Skip true when other local observers should continue without propagating to parents. Save the returned level for RESUME-EVENT-PROPAGATION." :position 327315)
("api/text" :names ("text" "(setf text)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Read the current UTF-8 text; returned storage survives later native calls. ABI36 carries explicit UTF-8 lengths and rejects embedded NUL on writes; multiline native values use LF-separated lines. Read-only controls still allow programmatic edits. Native positions are not Lisp string indices. COMBO-BOX is single-line: NUL/CR/LF writes reject. Clears old native selection then ChangeValue; matching-text selection readback remains native." :position 329048)
